    --- - `relativeTo`: Reference to the other region to which this region is anchored.
    --- - `relativePoint`: Point on the other region to which this region is anchored.
    --- - `offsetX`: Offset right (negative for left).
    --- - `offsetY`: Offset up (negative for down).
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_ScriptRegionResizing_GetPoint)
    function GetPoint(anchorIndex: number?, resolveCollapsed: boolean?): (AspectSecret<FramePoint, FramePoint | Secret<FramePoint>>, AspectSecret<ScriptRegion, ScriptRegion | Secret<ScriptRegion>>, AspectSecret<FramePoint, FramePoint | Secret<FramePoint>>, AspectSecret<uiUnit, uiUnit | Secret<uiUnit>>, AspectSecret<uiUnit, uiUnit | Secret<uiUnit>>)
    --- Returns an anchor point by name for the region.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_ScriptRegionResizing_GetPointByName)
    function GetPointByName(point: FramePoint, resolveCollapsed: boolean?): (AspectSecret<FramePoint, FramePoint | Secret<FramePoint>>, AspectSecret<ScriptRegion, ScriptRegion | Secret<ScriptRegion>>, AspectSecret<FramePoint, FramePoint | Secret<FramePoint>>, AspectSecret<uiUnit, uiUnit | Secret<uiUnit>>, AspectSecret<uiUnit, uiUnit | Secret<uiUnit>>)
