    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_TextureBase_SetColorTexture)
    function SetColorTexture(colorR: number | Secret<number>, colorG: number | Secret<number>, colorB: number | Secret<number>, a: (SingleColorValue | Secret<SingleColorValue>)?)
