    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_TextureBase_SetDesaturated)
    function SetDesaturated(desaturated: (boolean | Secret<boolean>)?)
    --- Sets the desaturation level of the texture.
