    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_TextureBase_SetSnapToPixelGrid)
    function SetSnapToPixelGrid(snap: boolean?)
    --- Sets the texture to show one cell of a sprite sheet.
