    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `text`: The message to output
    --- - `colorR`: The intensity of the red component.
    --- - `colorG`: The intensity of the green component.
    --- - `colorB`: The intensity of the blue component.
    --- - `a`: The opacity of the message. `0` is fully transparent, `1` is fully opaque.
    --- - `messageID`: A user-defined number that specifies which "color group" this message fits into. See the list of system-defined symbolic names. `GetChatTypeIndex`() can be used to turn a symbolic name into an integer index.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_MessageFrame_AddMessage)
