declare class UnitHealPredictionCalculator
    --- Calculates the percentage of current unit health and evaluates it against the supplied curve.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_EvaluateCurrentHealthPercent)
    function EvaluateCurrentHealthPercent(curve: LuaCurveObjectBase): LuaCurveEvaluatedResult
