    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetMaximumHealth)
    function GetMaximumHealth(): number
    --- Returns the configured maximum health mode.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetMaximumHealthMode)
    function GetMaximumHealthMode(): number
    --- Returns the maximum clamping amount for incoming heals.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetMaximumIncomingHeals)
    function GetMaximumIncomingHeals(): number
