    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetPredictedValues)
    function GetPredictedValues(): UnitHealPredictionValues
    --- Returns the base total amount of all applied damage absorb shields.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetTotalDamageAbsorbs)
    function GetTotalDamageAbsorbs(): number
    --- Returns the base total amount of all applied heal absorption effects.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_UnitHealPredictionCalculator_GetTotalHealAbsorbs)
