--- - `chatType`: The type of message to be sent, e.g. `"PARTY"`. If omitted, this defaults to `"SAY"`
--- - `languageID`: The languageID used for the message. Only works with chatTypes `"SAY"` and `"YELL"`, and only if not in a group. If omitted the default language will be used: Orcish for the Horde and Common for the Alliance, as returned by `GetDefaultLanguage`()
--- - `target`: The channel number or player name receiving the message for `"WHISPER"` or `"CHANNEL"` chatTypes.
