--- Returns info for a specialization.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `specIndex`: Index of the specialization to query, ascending from 1 to `GetNumSpecializations`().
--- - `isInspect`: Whether to query specialization information for the inspected unit. *Does not actually seem to work, you need to use `GetInspectSpecialization`() instead.*
--- - `isPet`: Whether to query specialization information for the player's pet.
--- - `inspectTarget`: UnitToken - The unit to request data for, when inspecting.
--- - `sex`: Player's sex as returned by `UnitSex`()
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `id`: SpecializationID
--- - `name`: Specialization name, e.g. "Balance".
--- - `description`: Description of the specialization, e.g. "Can take on the form of a powerful Moonkin, balancing the power of Arcane and Nature magic to destroy enemies at a distance."
--- - `icon`: FileID
--- - `role`: The intended role in a party: `"DAMAGER", "TANK", "HEALER"`
--- - `primaryStat`: The primary stat as listed in SPEC_STAT_STRINGS: `1=Strength, 2=Agility, 4=Intellect`
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetSpecializationInfo)
declare function GetSpecializationInfo(specializationIndex: number, isInspect: boolean?, isPet: boolean?, inspectTarget: string?, sex: number?, groupIndex: number?): (number?, string?, string?, fileID?, string?, number?, number?, string?, number?, boolean?)
--- Returns the index of the player's current specialization.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `isInspect`: if true, return information for the inspected player
--- - `isPet`: if true, return information for the player's pet.
--- - `specGroup`: The index of a given specialization/talent/glyph group (1 for primary / 2 for secondary).
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `currentSpec`: index of the current specialization (ascending from 1), or nil if no specialization is currently learned.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetSpecialization)
declare function GetSpecialization(isInspect: boolean?, isPet: boolean?, specGroupIndex: number?): number?
--- Returns the index of the current active specialization/talent/glyph group.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `isInspect`: (Defaults to false) - If true returns the information for the inspected unit instead of the player.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `activeSpec`: The index of the player's active specialization/talent/glyph group (1 for primary / 2 for secondary).
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetActiveSpecGroup)
declare function GetActiveSpecGroup(isInspect: boolean?, isPet: boolean?): number
--- Returns the mastery spell ID of the specified specialization.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `specIndex`: The index of the specialization to query (1, 2, 3, 4) (Druids have four specializations)
--- - `isInspect`: Reserved. Must be nil
--- - `isPet`: Reserved. Must be nil
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `masterySpell`: The Mastery spellID corresponding to one of the current player's specializations
--- - `masterySpell2`: The Mastery spellID corresponding to one of the current player's specializations
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetSpecializationMasterySpells)
declare function GetSpecializationMasterySpells(specializationIndex: number, isInspect: boolean?, isPet: boolean?): (number, number)
--- Returns info for the specified talent.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `tier`: Talent tier from 1 to `MAX_TALENT_TIERS`
--- - `column`: Talent column from 1 to `NUM_TALENT_COLUMNS`
--- - `specGroupIndex`: Index of active specialization group (`GetActiveSpecGroup`)
--- - `isInspect`: If non-nil, returns information based on inspectedUnit/classId.
--- - `inspectUnit`: UnitId - Inspected unit; if nil, the selected/available return values will always be false.
--- - `talentID`: Talent ID.
--- - `specIndex`: Index of the specialization, ascending from 1 to `GetNumSpecializations`().
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `talentID`: Talent ID.
--- - `name`: Talent name.
--- - `texture`: FileID
--- - `selected`: true if the talent is chosen, false otherwise.
--- - `available`: true if the talent tier is chosen, or if it is level-appropriate for the player and the player has no talents selected in that tier, false otherwise.
--- - `spellID`: Spell ID that is added to the spellbook.
--- - `row`: The row the talent is from. This will be the same as the tier argument given.
--- - `column`: The column the talent is from. This will be the same as the column argument given.
--- - `known`: true if the talent is active, false otherwise.
--- - `grantedByAura`: true if the talent is granted by an aura (i.e., an effect on an item), false otherwise. Legion's Class Soul rings used this rather than selected.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetTalentInfo)
declare function GetTalentInfo(talentTier: number, talentColumn: number, specGroupIndex: number, isInspect: boolean?, target: string?): (number, string, number, boolean, boolean, number, boolean, number, number, boolean, boolean)
