--- Returns item info for a guild bank slot.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `tab`: The index of the tab in the guild bank
--- - `slot`: The index of the slot in the chosen tab.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `texture`: The id of the texture to use for the item. Returns nil if there is no item.
--- - `itemCount`: The size of the item stack at the chosen slot. Returns 0 if there is no item.
--- - `locked`: Whether or not the slot is locked. Returns nil if it's not locked or the item doesn't exist, 1 otherwise.
--- - `isFiltered`: Returns true if the slot should be hidden because of the users filter, false otherwise.
--- - `quality`: The quality of the item at the chose slot. Returns nil if there is no item.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetGuildBankItemInfo)
declare function GetGuildBankItemInfo(tab: number, slot: number): (number?, number, boolean?, boolean, number?)
