---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `tab`: The index of the tab in the guild bank
--- - `slot`: The index of the slot in the provided tab.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `itemLink`: The item link for the item. Returns nil if there is no item.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetGuildBankItemLink)
declare function GetGuildBankItemLink(tab: number, slot: number): string?
