--- - `icon`: Path to the bank tab icon texture.
--- - `isViewable`: True if the player can click on the bank tab.
--- - `canDeposit`: True if the player can deposit items.
--- - `numWithdrawals`: Available withdrawals per day.
--- - `remainingWithdrawals`: Remaining withdrawals for the day.
--- - `filtered`: True if the requested tab is filtered out.
