--- Returns info for a guild member.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: Ranging from 1 to `GetNumGuildMembers`()
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `name`: Name of character with realm (e.g. "Arthas-Silvermoon")
--- - `rankName`: Name of character's guild rank (e.g. Guild Master, Officer, Member, ...)
--- - `rankIndex`: Index of rank starting at 0 for GM (add 1 for GuildControlGetRankName(index))
--- - `level`: Character's level
--- - `classDisplayName`: Localized class name (e.g. "Mage", "Warrior", "Guerrier", ...)
--- - `zone`: Character's location (last location if offline)
--- - `publicNote`: Character's public note, returns "" if you can't view notes or no note
--- - `officerNote`: Character's officer note, returns "" if you can't view notes or no note
--- - `isOnline`: true: online - false: offline
--- - `status`: 0: none - 1: AFK - 2: Busy (Do Not Disturb) (changed in 4.3.2)
--- - `class`: Localization-independent class name (e.g. "MAGE", "WARRIOR", "DEATHKNIGHT", ...)
--- - `achievementPoints`: Character's achievement points
--- - `achievementRank`: Where the character ranks in guild if sorted by achievement points
--- - `isMobile`: true: player logged into app with this character
--- - `canSoR`: true: can use Scroll of Resurrection on character (deprecated)
--- - `repStanding`: Standing ID for character's guild reputation
--- - `guid`: Character's GUID
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetGuildRosterInfo)
declare function GetGuildRosterInfo(index: number): (string, string, number, number, string, string, string, string, boolean, number, string, number, number, boolean, boolean, number, string)
