--- Returns File IDs of tabard textures used in guild bank logo.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `tabardBackgroundUpper`: FileID
--- - `tabardBackgroundLower`: FileID
--- - `tabardEmblemUpper`: FileID
--- - `tabardEmblemLower`: FileID
--- - `tabardBorderUpper`: FileID
--- - `tabardBorderLower`: FileID
