---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `message`: The index of the message to query, in the range of [1,GetInboxNumItems()]
--- - `attachment`: The index of the attachment to query, in the range of [1,ATTACHMENTS_MAX_RECEIVE]
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `itemLink`: The ItemLink for the specified item
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetInboxItemLink)
declare function GetInboxItemLink(message: number, attachment: number): string
--- Returns the number of messages in the mailbox.
