--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetInboxNumItems)
declare function GetInboxNumItems(): (number, number)
--- Returns the text of a message in the mailbox.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: the index of the message (1 is the first message)
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `bodyText`: the text of the message.
--- - `stationaryMiddle`: the texture for the middle of the stationary.
--- - `stationaryEdge`: the texture for the edge of the stationary.
--- - `isTakeable`: whether the copy of the mail text has been taken.
--- - `isInvoice`: not nil if the message is an auction house Invoice. see GetInboxInvoiceInfo()
--- - `isConsortium`: indicates the message relates to crafting work orders. see C_Mail.GetCraftingOrderMailInfo()
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetInboxText)
declare function GetInboxText(index: number): (string, string, string, boolean, boolean?, boolean)
