--- Get cooldown information for an inventory item.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `unit`: UnitId - The unit whose inventory is to be queried.
--- - `invSlotId`: InventorySlotId - to be queried, obtained via GetInventorySlotInfo.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `start`: The start time of the cooldown period, or 0 if there is no cooldown (or no item in the slot)
--- - `duration`: The duration of the cooldown period (NOT the remaining time). 0 if the item has no use/cooldown or the slot is empty.
--- - `enable`: Returns 1 or 0. 1 if the inventory item is capable of having a cooldown, 0 if not.
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetInventoryItemCooldown)
