--- - `minLevel`: Earliest level permitted to walk into the instance portal
--- - `maxLevel`: Highest level permitted to walk into the instance portal
--- - `recLevel`: Recommended level to queue for this dungeon
--- - `minRecLevel`: Earliest level to queue for this dungeon
--- - `maxRecLevel`: Highest level to queue for this dungeon
