--- Returns info about a Raid Finder dungeon by index. Limited by player level and other factors, so only Raid Finder dungeons listed in the LFG tool can be looked up.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `index`: index of a Raid Finder dungeon, from 1 to `GetNumRFDungeons`()
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `id`: Dungeon ID
--- - `name`: The name of the dungeon/event
--- - `typeID`: 1=TYPEID_DUNGEON or LFR, 2=raid instance, 4=outdoor area, 6=TYPEID_RANDOM_DUNGEON
--- - `subtypeID`: 0=Unknown, 1=LFG_SUBTYPEID_DUNGEON, 2=LFG_SUBTYPEID_HEROIC, 3=LFG_SUBTYPEID_RAID, 4=LFG_SUBTYPEID_SCENARIO, 5=LFG_SUBTYPEID_FLEXRAID
--- - `minLevel`: Earliest level you can enter this dungeon (using the portal, not LFD)
--- - `maxLevel`: Highest level you can enter this dungeon (using the portal, not LFD)
--- - `recLevel`: Recommended level to queue up for this dungeon
--- - `minRecLevel`: Earliest level you can queue up for the dungeon
--- - `maxRecLevel`: Highest level you can queue up for the dungeon
--- - `expansionLevel`: Referring to GetAccountExpansionLevel() values
--- - `groupID`: Unknown
--- - `textureFilename`: For example "Interface\LFDFRAME\LFGIcon-%s.blp" where %s is the textureFilename value
--- - `difficulty`: 0 for Normal and 1 for Heroic
--- - `maxPlayers`: Maximum players allowed
--- - `description`: Usually empty for most dungeons but events contain descriptions of the event, like Love is in the Air daily or Brewfest, e.g. (string)
--- - `isHoliday`: If true then this is a holiday event
--- - `bonusRepAmount`: Unknown
--- - `minPlayers`: Minimum number of players (before the group disbands?); usually nil
--- - `isTimeWalking`: If true then it's Timewalking Dungeon
--- - `name2`: Returns the name of the raid
--- - `minGearLevel`: The minimum average item level to queue for this dungeon; may be 0 if item level is ignored.
--- - `lfgMapID`: InstanceID
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetRFDungeonInfo)
declare function GetRFDungeonInfo(index: number): (number, string, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, number, string, number, number, string, boolean, number, number?, boolean, string, number, boolean, number)
