--- Returns info about a specific encounter from a saved instance lockout.
---
--- **Parameters**
--- - `instanceIndex`: Index from 1 to `GetNumSavedInstances`()
--- - `encounterIndex`: Index from 1 to the number of encounters in the instance. For multi-part raids, this includes bosses that are not in that raid section, so the first boss in the second wing of a Raid Finder raid could actually have an encounterIndex of '4'.
---
--- **Returns**
--- - `bossName`: The localized name of the encounter in question
--- - `fileDataID`: The `Texture_SetTexture` for a texture associated with the encounter, usually an achievement icon. If Blizzard hasn't designated one for the encounter, expect this return to be nil.
--- - `isKilled`: True if you have killed/looted the boss since the last reset period
--- - `unknown4`: Unused by Blizzard, has an unknown purpose, and seems to always be false
---
--- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_GetSavedInstanceEncounterInfo)
declare function GetSavedInstanceEncounterInfo(instanceIndex: number, encounterIndex: number): (string, number?, boolean, boolean)
