--- - `lockoutId`: the ID of the instance lockout
--- - `reset`: the number of seconds remaining until the instance resets
--- - `difficultyId`: DifficultyID
--- - `locked`: true if the instance is currently locked, false for a historic entry
--- - `extended`: shows true if the ID has been extended
--- - `instanceIDMostSig`: unknown
--- - `isRaid`: shows true if it is a raid
--- - `maxPlayers`: shows the max players
--- - `difficultyName`: shows a localized string i.e. 10 Player (Heroic)
--- - `numEncounters`: number of boss encounters in this instance
--- - `encounterProgress`: farthest boss encounter in this instance for player
--- - `extendDisabled`: returns whether this instance cannot be disabled
--- - `instanceId`: InstanceID
