    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ToyBox.GetNumToys)
    function GetNumToys(): number
    --- Returns a toy by index.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `index`: Ranging from 1 to `C_ToyBox.GetNumFilteredToys`.
    ---
    --- **Returns**
    --- - `itemID`: The Item ID of the toy. Returns `-1` if the index is invalid.
    ---
    --- [warcraft.wiki.gg](https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/API_C_ToyBox.GetToyFromIndex)
    function GetToyFromIndex(index: number): number
    --- Returns toy info.
    ---
    --- **Parameters**
    --- - `itemID`: The itemID returned from `C_ToyBox.GetToyFromIndex`(); possible values listed at ToyID.
