    --- Returns whether the player is the only member of their WoW Labs party.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    function IsAloneInWoWLabsParty(): (...unknown)
    --- Returns whether the player came back to the WoW Labs lobby through fast login, such as when requeueing after a match.
    ---
    --- *Description by wowlua: the API's documentation has none.*
    function IsFastLogin(): (...unknown)
